{"v":4,"catch":"在那個強權就是唯一正義的時代…","desc":"《Rastan Saga II》是TAITO於1988年發行的動作遊戲。\n它是原版《Rastan Saga》的前傳，講述了Rastan如何透過拯救Rastania的神聖土地而贏得名聲的故事。\n在與邪惡邪教的戰鬥中獲得各種武器和魔法物品，以保護摩天大樓的寺廟。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-06-20","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d024c99cbc0064aff56ce05f7b87c081738b4d663b131ba97fbe04201b34bbc8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/57e19f892341e857f61c6df80b6256c8d6186ce69a7f9cb4edbcb5f5e8e064d0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0973c5260b83c5e4a34ccbef1ad07849c0327345b30821d13b635e4533975d24.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c9a65b32f0bee1c8fc213967e37553d8c1843dd80a24296bdabe9fc1d67a4ab4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cab8ab1baee0d43569b3c7053fcbc71d9b400f431e48f95ebbd1e145ea15f277.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e05072ffc0ff6360c8e5f2cf6c6b1de6ed3cbdb4b072c2b91d4bcabecb11ec37.jpg"],"titleId":"0100cab01ea6e000","dlc":[]}